Package: omnivm
Version: __VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: virtiofsd, e2fsprogs, iptables, iproute2
Maintainer: SalyyS1 <1tranducnhan.2021@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SalyyS1/omnivm
Description: Scale-to-zero microVM runtime on Cloud Hypervisor
 OmniVM runs untrusted workloads inside isolated Linux microVMs that
 pause when idle and wake on demand. Includes the ovmd daemon, ovm CLI,
 Cloud Hypervisor VMM, and a prebuilt microVM kernel.
